    "body": "I've tried to make this better by using generics to not need to duplicate the logic that finds the relevant fields for the yaml and json case and also left a comment as to why to have the two codepaths.\r\n\r\nI do agree kubeconfigs of this size are unusual but it is not \"a bit\" more speed, its about 77% faster so this makes a really huge difference once you do have such a kubeconfig.",
